seg-fb1342b76953 = Seven masks, each the constant-temperature (within ±{ "1" } K) MTIE and TDEV wander-generation limit, defined through the equivalent { "10" } Hz first-order low-pass measurement filter the clauses state. That filter acts before sampling, so the kind takes the record as already measured through it and applies nothing. The PRC mask is for an autonomous clock (G.810 Figure 2a independent clock configuration); the others are locked-mode limits for a clock synchronised to a wander-free reference. The reference scenario is <c1/>: a free-running OCXO against the three EEC masks, which overstates the oscillator's contribution at observation intervals long against any loop's time constant.

